DATABASE_URL=mongodb://localhost:27017/mydatabase
PORT=3000
```

### Step 3: Load Environment Variables

At the very beginning of your application (usually in the entry point file like `index.js` or `app.js`), you need to require and configure `dotenv`. This will load the variables from the `.env` file into `process.env`.

