	err := copyFile("input.txt", "output.txt")
	if err != nil {
		panic(err)
	}
}
```

`io.Copy` handles buffering internally using a 32KB buffer by default and works for any `io.Reader` → `io.Writer` pair (files, network connections, buffers, etc.).

