- The leading project aiming to fix this is [Valhalla](https://openjdk.org/projects/valhalla/), but as of JDK 24 (March 2024), it remains *preview/experimental* and has **not** landed in the standard `java.util` collections (e.g., `List`, `ArrayList`) — they still box primitives.
