1. A `FailureDetector` class that tracks node heartbeats and failure status
2. A simple phi-accrual calculation based on heartbeat intervals
3. Timeout handling with expiration times
4. Failure detection logic that marks nodes as failed when phi value exceeds threshold
5. Thread-safe concurrent data structures for node tracking

