5. **Output the Result**: Print the modified vector to verify the result.

### Solution Code

```cpp
#include <vector>
#include <ranges>
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    std::vector<int> vec = {10, 3, 7, 4, 6, 2};

    // Define the predicate to check for even numbers
    auto is_even = [](int x) { return x % 2 == 0; };

    // Partition the vector in place using stable_partition_inplace_fast
    std::ranges::stable_partition_inplace_fast(vec, is_even);

    // Print the resulting vector
    for (int num : vec) {
        std::cout << num << " ";
    }
    std::cout << std::endl;
}
```

### Explanation
