}
```

### How to get it

```bash
go get github.com/evansd/json-fast@latest   # fetches the module
# (or replace that URL with whatever repo hosts the jsonfast implementation you use)
```

The key points are:

1. **Import with an alias** (`jsonf`) so you can still refer to the standard `encoding/json` if needed.
