To ensure that all nodes agree on the same value, the `Consensus` class maintains a separate thread that waits for a certain amount of time after each proposal and then checks if all nodes have voted on it. If not, the `Consensus` class sends a new proposal to all nodes and repeats the process until agreement is reached.

