### Architectural Guide for a BFT Service in C++

Since a full production BFT implementation (like PBFT or HotStuff) is thousands of lines of code, I will provide a **simplified conceptual implementation** of a single-round agreement using a "Voting" mechanism.

#### 1. The Core Components
To build this, you will need:
