#### Test it

```bash
# Write a value (any node can be the leader)
curl -X POST -d '{"key":"foo","value":"bar"}' http://127.0.0.1:8002/set

# Read it back (any node)
curl http://127.0.0.1:8003/get?key=foo
# => {"key":"foo","value":"bar"}
