## 5. TL;DR – What you need to copy

```toml
# Cargo.toml
[dependencies]
tokio = { version = "1.38", features = ["full"] }
sqlx = { version = "0.7", features = ["postgres", "runtime-tokio-native-tls", "macros"] }
