## 6️⃣ Quick checklist before you ship

| ✅ | Item |
|---|------|
| **Install** | `npm i @secure-io/sanitize` |
| **Import** | `import { sanitize } from '@secure-io/sanitize'` |
| **Sanitize** | Call `sanitize(userHtml)` **once** (never on already‑sanitized output) |
| **Store / Render** | Store the returned string; it is safe to inject with `innerHTML` or send back to the client |
