// ============================================================================
// pbft.cpp - Simplified PBFT (Practical Byzantine Fault Tolerance) Demo
// ============================================================================
//
// IMPORTANT: Byzantine fault tolerance requires n >= 3f + 1 nodes.
// The request for n = 2f is mathematically impossible. Here's why:
