| Design a non-Turing-complete language where termination is guaranteed | ✅ Yes (total functional languages) |
| Prove termination for *some* programs automatically | ✅ Yes (termination checkers, but incomplete) |
| Bound execution time with a fuel counter | ✅ Yes (engineering, not proof) |

