That said, here's how you'd do constant-time comparison with the two crates I do know:

### Option 1: `subtle` (most common)

```rust
use subtle::ConstantTimeEq;

fn ct_eq(a: &[u8], b: &[u8]) -> bool {
    // ct_eq returns a Choice (wrapper around u8); .into() converts to bool.
    a.ct_eq(b).into()
