}
```

**2. SIMD-accelerated bulk formatting** — this isn't in the standard, but the [{fmt}](https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt) library has experimental SIMD-accelerated numeric formatting (used internally by some JSON/database projects). With {fmt you can do:

